# Copy to .env.production (or supply as a build-time env var, however the
# eventual production build is produced) for a real deployment.
#
# The variable is genuinely named VITE_SERVER_URL_DEV even for a production
# build - it's the only API-origin variable this app reads (src/config/env.ts),
# there is no separate "prod" variant today. Renaming it is a real, if small,
# frontend code change (env.ts + api.ts) that's out of scope for this pass;
# flagged here so it isn't mistaken for a typo.
VITE_SERVER_URL_DEV=https://api.yourdomain.example/
